<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The launcher icon's foreground: a handset with two waves leaving it (Task 66).

  108x108 with the glyph inside the 66dp safe circle, because every launcher mask -
  circle, squircle, rounded square - crops what falls outside it, and an icon that is
  correct only on the shape the designer happened to look at is an icon that is wrong on
  somebody's phone. Nothing here reaches further than r34 from the centre.

  A vector, not a set of PNGs: minSdk is 26, so adaptive icons are available on every
  device this app runs on, and one file replaces five density buckets of bitmaps that
  nobody can review in a diff.
-->
